   "label": "信使是什麼？",
   "x": 1494,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 1088,
   "height": 992
  },
  {
   "id": "b503d9bb1f55ecce",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "化石為何再現？",
   "x": 8972,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 1028
  },
  {
   "id": "83a056d93f512c5f",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "南極考察點",
   "x": 2590,
   "y": 612,
   "width": 1088,
   "height": 544
  },
  {
   "id": "6eca50fefd90742f",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "星降神臨在做什麼？",
   "x": 4392,
   "y": 152,
   "width": 698,
   "height": 568
  },
  {
   "id": "a19268416bb74cc2",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "深海之星知道什麼？",
   "x": 7802,
   "y": 576,
   "width": 1088,
   "height": 580
  },
  {
   "id": "54446d7342cadeac",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "米迦勒從何而來？",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 152,
   "width": 1478,
   "height": 3124
  },
  {
   "id": "f728a344dcb8e070",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "誰撕走日誌？",
   "x": 9362,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 1004
  },
  {
   "id": "d77fd7bd519e2317",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "誰進過神殿？",
   "x": 3686,
   "y": 588,
   "width": 698,
   "height": 956
  },
  {
   "id": "51bf28efe2999b05",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "鳥人文明發生了什麼？",
   "x": 5172,
   "y": 176,
   "width": 698,
   "height": 2652
  },
  {
   "id": "aae2f427b2d4652c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**孫天烺投資考察**\n\n投資南極考察",
   "x": 5976,
   "y": 1032,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "8788182f348228eb",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**大門打開喚醒信使**\n\n大門打開，信使與怪物被喚醒，澤井陽基控制信使、天城博敏",
   "x": 5976,
   "y": 1432,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "2c1d52af8dbc8b80",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**天城博敏下落不明**\n\n天城博敏中止考察，回到美國完成論文後與化石先後下落不明",
   "x": 5976,
   "y": 1844,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "b0f0b17ce83156d6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "官方認定考察成果造假",
   "x": 5976,
   "y": 2316,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "245110a3f185ca61",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**美嘉留被帶走送回**\n\n突然出現帶走美嘉留，不久後美嘉留被送回家",
   "x": 5976,
   "y": 2716,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "7f3cc09e8dfb714d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**澤井考察後失蹤**\n\n在南極考察後失蹤",
   "x": 6366,
   "y": 1444,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "d7510084d4f30d74",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**深海之星派人鑑定**\n\n深海之星派斯普魯恩斯確認化石真實性，鑑定報告證明化石確屬海之住民，需回收以保密海之住民存在",
   "x": 5926,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 172,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "5fe73754bdc89535",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**斯普魯恩斯收手**\n\n斯普魯恩斯追上水妖並短暫交手，因人魚公主出現而收手",
   "x": 6316,
   "y": 172,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3848fc21923aac7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**斯普魯恩斯回收化石**\n\n斯普魯恩斯在人魚公主擊敗水妖後回收化石",
   "x": 6316,
   "y": 608,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "2d78c6748e96597d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "LB奉命搶奪化石",
   "x": 7486,
   "y": 208,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "27c093668e0c1504",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**美嘉參觀展覽**\n\n美嘉收到信件，在海斗陪同下參觀展覽",
   "x": 7096,
   "y": 172,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "7790d3da7fd4a641",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**要求塞雷亞申請**\n\n斯普魯恩斯無法提供詳細訊息予非成員，要求塞雷亞向深海之星提交查詢申請",
   "x": 6706,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "4e5f5be5792a1310",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**器具建築不合人型**\n\n器具、建築設計不適合人型生物使用",
   "x": 1908,
   "y": 172,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "e65edcd4dae0432a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**人頭鳥身有光環**\n\n人頭鳥身，其中一隻有光環",
   "x": 2298,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "fee406f3838bb244",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "完整化石不足半米高",
   "x": 1518,
   "y": 208,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "109abb1fc82ce8f2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "信使是鳥人原生樣貌",
   "x": 1572,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "4d07e8d2bb77c097",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "光環是特殊象徵",
   "x": 1962,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "69b3e3bfeeaa2e26",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "信使是王的複製品",
   "x": 1962,
   "y": 1056,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "9581db5db3b8e335",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**化石與米迦勒利害**\n\n化石對米迦勒有用/不利",
   "x": 8996,
   "y": 620,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "2445559453bc420c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**內部人員賣化石**\n\n化石已回收封存，應是內部人員賣至黑市",
   "x": 8996,
   "y": 1020,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "279f504267d1b93b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**南極化石關乎米迦勒**\n\n化石來自南極，可能伴有遺跡，與米迦勒身份相關",
   "x": 8996,
   "y": 172,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "340d24d346e2125b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "傳家寶",
   "x": 3320,
   "y": 1056,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "7bf7394a80750656",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "航海日誌",
   "x": 3394,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "b629c28b6ab81412",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "地圖",
   "x": 3004,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "7043d938b4d8fc6a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**南極山洞深處神殿遺跡**\n\n南極一山洞深處的神殿遺跡",
   "x": 2930,
   "y": 1032,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb4ca9e88ca40c60",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "壁畫",
   "x": 2614,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "5634dd283cdce7d9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "MS資料",
   "x": 4416,
   "y": 208,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2b12e33e5e0ffab",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "研究將生物改造成MS",
   "x": 4416,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "fa5bdb224ceb6183",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**星降神臨改造生物**\n\n星降神臨的核心功能是改造生物",
   "x": 4806,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "80f5ea82c3c689f0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "星降神臨長期收集基質",
   "x": 4806,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "3f1010709d797684",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "刻意讓人魚公主解決",
   "x": 8216,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d973953c1da4c8ed",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "塞雷亞有保密義務",
   "x": 7826,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "800d548291223225",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**斯普魯恩斯冷漠**\n\n斯普魯恩斯對米迦勒事件態度冷漠",
   "x": 8606,
   "y": 608,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "40ad1231ca584ea2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**深海之星知真相**\n\n深海之星知道人魚公主的真相",
   "x": 8411,
   "y": 1032,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "bd56e05068d27bfb",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**米迦勒氣息似美嘉留**\n\n美嘉留與米迦勒氣息相似",
   "x": 683,
   "y": 2728,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "dd1de8e54f66d6d8",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**美嘉留衰弱**\n\n米迦勒出現時美嘉留衰弱",
   "x": 422,
   "y": 2292,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "f8fc986183cd6074",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**海之住民不自稱**\n\n海之住民不會自稱海之住民",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 1856,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "0985f8fd90121ce3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "米迦勒空間裡的城堡",
   "x": 1182,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "5e2a16404349dfa3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**植入產生米迦勒**\n\n米迦勒：將奴隸DNA植入美嘉留產生",
   "x": 552,
   "y": 3128,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "46e82b7f1c818ca1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**現代人排斥DNA**\n\n現代人類會對DNA產生排斥",
   "x": 812,
   "y": 2292,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "87efa66703570a6d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**古代血統者不排斥**\n\n帶有古代人類血統的人不會排斥DNA，但僅能重現人格，且人格無法控制宿主，反而會受美嘉留影響",
   "x": 1202,
   "y": 2256,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 172,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "cefa09474cc7827b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**美嘉留彭達拉薩血統**\n\n美嘉留擁有彭達拉薩血統",
   "x": 580,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "14b58415dc5b8da8",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**依靠美嘉留力量顯現**\n\n依靠美嘉留的力量顯現",
   "x": 1137,
   "y": 2728,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d761aa1c4c5fa985",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**自稱由現代人告知**\n\n米迦勒的自稱是現代人告訴他的",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 2292,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "e591cf42d996c0cc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**有人喚醒或復活米迦勒**\n\n有人喚醒/復活米迦勒",
   "x": 97,
   "y": 2728,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "f3b5471265fe9e03",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "米迦勒與鳥人一族有關",
   "x": 1192,
   "y": 1056,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "8b1580762774e235",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**正本失蹤副本被撕**\n\n正本失蹤，副本只有抵達前的部分，抵達後（以未知語言寫成）的部分被撕走",
   "x": 9386,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "8e39317ecdc980a3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "看懂的人想要隱瞞",
   "x": 9386,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "a3e62c60212bda03",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "澤井陽基",
   "x": 9386,
   "y": 1056,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "9435461df2110d14",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**張睿稱神殿大門關閉**\n\n張睿稱神殿大門處於關閉狀態",
   "x": 3784,
   "y": 620,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "73a51a9510de1f37",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**大門人力推不開**\n\n大門以人類的力氣無法推開",
   "x": 4100,
   "y": 1032,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "fddc5f9a48616572",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**考察隊走後有人進入**\n\n考察隊離開後有人進入神殿",
   "x": 3710,
   "y": 1032,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "4559b45a95724e06",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "使用法術",
   "x": 3905,
   "y": 1468,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "63cfe89b74f44089",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "未知語言",
   "x": 5366,
   "y": 208,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "aa4557a1c3e90b26",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "警告石碑",
   "x": 5196,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "a1c3d3bf984d1484",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "恐懼使人瘋狂",
   "x": 5586,
   "y": 644,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "51c67c390e1533e0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "製造出信使實行計劃",
   "x": 5586,
   "y": 1056,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d324ef0c90caa157",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**種族衰落研究復興之法**\n\n種族因不明原因步向衰落，族人研究復興種族之法",
   "x": 5196,
   "y": 1020,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "02583b1049563ac4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**捨棄肉體保留靈魂**\n\n捨棄肉體保留靈魂，將來轉移至新容器",
   "x": 5196,
   "y": 1432,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "b3548a308f99dbd1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**奴隸DNA容器實驗**\n\n以奴隸之DNA進行製造容器實驗",
   "x": 5196,
   "y": 1844,
